MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_Pet_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_Pet_m01_001: Well, the ornius got away. We got roughed up for\nnothing, and now I'm starving.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_Pet_m01_002: Hey, no need to get so down about it. I bet it'll\nwander back this way eventually.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_Pet_m01_003: You're probably right. Maybe we should try putting\nout some bait?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_Pet_m01_004: Oh, hey, do you think Tialla managed to run all\nthose errands for her grandpa yet?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_Pet_m01: <BLN>Ughhh...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B01_m01_001: Hey, Cai! Have you seen Castor?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B01_m01_002: He helped my mother out the other day.\nCan you tell him I said thanks?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B01_m01: <BLN>Where's Castor?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B02_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B02_m01_001: A traveling merchant came through. Said a bunch\nof ruffians were awful interested in the village.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B02_m01_002: I'm hoping it was all in the merchant's head. Still, we\noughta stay on alert anyways. Just in case.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B02_m01: <BLN>Something else to worry about...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B03_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B03_m01_001: Cai, you can't stay out playing forever. It's about time\nyou went home!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B03_m01_002: When the sun goes down, you head home and\nstraight to bed, like a good boy is supposed to!
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B03_m01: <BLN>Time to go home, Cai.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B04_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B04_m01_002: I saw Tialla running off looking frantic. You two\ndidn't have an argument, did ya?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B04_m01: <BLN>What's going on?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B05_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B05_m01_001: Cai, I just saw a super-big guy in some grand armor!
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B05_m01_002: I guess that's what a knight looks like, huh?\nI saw him walk farther into the village.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B05_m01: <BLN>Is that what a knight looks like?
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B06_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B06_m01_001: A relative wrote to tell me the viceroy of Liber is\ngoing to raise the annual tax rate.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B06_m01_002: Damn it, just how much are those guys going to try\nand squeeze us for?
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B06_m01: <BLN>We only have so much...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B07_m01_001: We're born in this village, work to make it good,\nraise children, then die.
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B07_m01_002: My father, my grandfather, and all my people before\nthem lived just like that too.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B07_m01: <BLN>Me, and all the others too...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B08_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B08_m01_001: The many blessings of the soil, the wind, the sky that\ngoes on forever...
MID_LGV_1KAI_c01_B08_m01_002: Ribeira may not be a wealthy village, but there's\nenough for us to live a simple life.
MID_LGA_1KAI_c01_B08_m01: <BLN>What a lovely view!